# WÜRTH LANKA — CHEQUE RETURN INTELLIGENCE & RECOVERY ANALYTICS PLATFORM

## 1. Your Role

Act as a senior enterprise software architect, data analyst, financial risk analyst, business intelligence developer, and UX designer.

Build a production-oriented internal web application for WÜRTH Lanka's Recovery Department.

**Application name:** WÜRTH Recovery Intelligence

**Primary purpose:** Convert returned-cheque records into actionable business intelligence. The application must help the Recovery team understand why cheques are being returned, which customers and account managers contribute most to the problem, where financial exposure is concentrated, which cases require urgent attention, and which recovery actions are producing results.

This is not merely an Excel replacement or a dashboard displaying totals. It must function as a decision-support platform.

