7. Financial totals reconcile to the included source records.
8. Recovery totals update correctly after verified partial and full recoveries.
9. An unresolved case is not automatically classified as recovered.
10. AI insights do not introduce unsupported figures.
11. Access permissions are enforced beyond the UI.
12. Unauthorized users cannot alter protected records or audit events.
13. Invalid data is flagged and handled transparently.
14. Empty or insufficient historical data produces clear messages rather than fabricated insights.
15. Exports reconcile with the selected filters and underlying data.
16. Audit events are recorded for sensitive changes.

